{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846470/extras/bc4612a536d4064353744571b394d54d.avif?t=1767563556\" width=600 height=264 /></span>You\u2019re not alone out here. Every step you take echoes through a deadly world where you are both predator and prey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for weapons, stalk your rivals, and strike before they do \u2014 but always watch your back. Because while you\u2019re hunting\u2026 someone else is hunting you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846470/extras/8d7712f62cd12c4d6de4826d346dfcdf.avif?t=1767563556\" width=600 height=264 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dense forests, climb rocky cliffs, and cross treacherous terrain in search of an advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A beautiful place can still be your grave. Never trust the silence of nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The forest may shelter you \u2013 but it also hides your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846470/extras/22709d364c5918d8d9f53bafa451787c.avif?t=1767563556\" width=600 height=264 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed alone won\u2019t save you \u2014 you need to be hungry, alert, and prepared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather berries, hunt small animals, and cook to keep yourself alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pods contain vital supplies \u2014 but when the storm hits, you won\u2019t be the only one chasing them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The weather shifts. Threats move. And you need to be ready for both.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3846470?t=1767563556","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846470/cbad53db2ea570479e15f558792230eec6aa90c4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767563556","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846470/6169c4bcd02a377dbb1eb1975589f0ee6557ccd4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767563556","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846470/6169c4bcd02a377dbb1eb1975589f0ee6557ccd4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767563556","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains stylized blood effects, such as blood splatter on weapons and the environment. It also features mannequin-like characters with anatomically neutral, unclothed appearances. No sexual content is present."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846470/extras/bc4612a536d4064353744571b394d54d.avif?t=1767563556\" width=600 height=264 /></span>You\u2019re not alone out here. Every step you take echoes through a deadly world where you are both predator and prey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for weapons, stalk your rivals, and strike before they do \u2014 but always watch your back. Because while you\u2019re hunting\u2026 someone else is hunting you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846470/extras/8d7712f62cd12c4d6de4826d346dfcdf.avif?t=1767563556\" width=600 height=264 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dense forests, climb rocky cliffs, and cross treacherous terrain in search of an advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A beautiful place can still be your grave. Never trust the silence of nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The forest may shelter you \u2013 but it also hides your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846470/extras/22709d364c5918d8d9f53bafa451787c.avif?t=1767563556\" width=600 height=264 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed alone won\u2019t save you \u2014 you need to be hungry, alert, and prepared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather berries, hunt small animals, and cook to keep yourself alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pods contain vital supplies \u2014 but when the storm hits, you won\u2019t be the only one chasing them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The weather shifts. Threats move. And you need to be ready for both.</p>","developers":["Jimmy Byberg"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846470/5489e48463ba7b79757819ac0c19fd9b020e3724/header.jpg?t=1767563556","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/s